{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_LOKI",
      "label": "Loki (Grafana Cloud logs)",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "loki",
      "pluginName": "Loki"
    },
    {
      "name": "DS_PROM",
      "label": "Prometheus (Grafana Cloud metrics)",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "title": "Jarvis overview (UNVERIFIED until Gate 3)",
  "uid": "jarvis-overview",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "tags": ["jarvis"],
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "dailyBudgetUsd",
        "label": "dailyBudgetUsd",
        "type": "constant",
        "query": "20",
        "hide": 0,
        "current": {
          "value": "20",
          "text": "20"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "UNVERIFIED until Gate 3",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Do not trust this dashboard yet.** It was written without Alloy installed, without a Grafana Cloud account and without any Claude Code run having exported OTLP.\n\n- Metric names (`claude_code_token_usage_tokens_total`), CLI log events (`tool_result`, rate-limit) and their label names are taken from the CLI's \"Monitoring usage\" documentation and the plan, and the OTLP-to-Prometheus name translation is a guess. Check them in Explore against the installed CLI first.\n- Engine panels depend on the `event` / `role` labels produced by `deploy/alloy/config.alloy`, which has never been run.\n- `stopReason` is not logged yet (arrives in a later task); no panel here depends on it.\n- Postgres is the source of truth for cost and budgets (ADR-0016). Grafana numbers are for looking, never for deciding."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Engine: seconds since last log line",
      "description": "There is no heartbeat-success log line (the heartbeat pings healthchecks.io). This is the age of the newest engine journald line of any kind, so a quiet but healthy engine also grows. healthchecks.io is the real liveness signal; this panel only corroborates it.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "time() - max(timestamp(last_over_time({unit=\"jarvis-engine.service\"}[1h])))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 900
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 3600
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "heartbeat.failed (last 24h)",
      "description": "Count of `heartbeat.failed` lines.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({unit=\"jarvis-engine.service\", event=\"heartbeat.failed\"}[24h]))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Runs started per hour, by role",
      "description": "`run.started` lines.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (role) (count_over_time({unit=\"jarvis-engine.service\", event=\"run.started\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{role}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Runs finished per hour, by role",
      "description": "`run.finished` lines.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (role) (count_over_time({unit=\"jarvis-engine.service\", event=\"run.finished\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{role}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Cost per day vs dailyBudgetUsd",
      "description": "Sum of `costUsd` over `run.finished` lines, rolling 24h. Postgres is the source of truth for cost and budgets (ADR-0016, LIM-04); this panel can disagree with it and never drives a budget decision. The budget line is the dashboard variable `dailyBudgetUsd`: keep it equal to `jarvis.config.json`.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(sum_over_time({unit=\"jarvis-engine.service\", event=\"run.finished\"} | json | unwrap costUsd [24h]))",
          "legendFormat": "cost, last 24h"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "vector($dailyBudgetUsd)",
          "legendFormat": "dailyBudgetUsd"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tokens by model and type",
      "description": "`claude_code.token.usage` from the CLI, by `type` (input, output, cacheRead, cacheCreation). Name translation unverified.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (model, type) (increase(claude_code_token_usage_tokens_total{service_name=\"jarvis-claude\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} {{type}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tool errors",
      "description": "CLI `tool_result` log events with `success=false`, via OTLP. Label and attribute names unverified.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=\"jarvis-claude\"} |= \"tool_result\" |= \"false\" [1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "tool errors"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Rate-limit events",
      "description": "CLI log events mentioning a rate limit or HTTP 429. Free-text match; unverified.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=\"jarvis-claude\"} |~ \"(?i)rate.?limit|429\" [1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "rate-limit"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Last 50 lifecycle lines",
      "description": "Engine lines that carry an `event` key.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 10
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "{unit=\"jarvis-engine.service\", event=~\".+\"}",
          "queryType": "range",
          "maxLines": 50
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true
      }
    }
  ]
}
